Reading: cost is a STEP FUNCTION in the residual top-jump depth, not in rung count —
d2-top members 36-71k marginal-to-first, d3-top members 288-524k, d4-top members > 30M
(bound). Within equal top depth the direction mildly reverses (larger library base).
Coarsening concentrates the removed rungs' work into the top's exponent.
